// call __veldKey.get() if it knows the helper name, but it can't harvest
// the key by blind-enumeration of a well-known storage key, and it
// doesn't persist across reloads (the user re-unlocks the encrypted
// keystore each time the tab is opened — acceptable UX hit for the
